.TH GSR-UI 1 "2024-08-01" "gsr-ui" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
gsr-ui \- A fullscreen overlay UI for GPU Screen Recorder in the style of ShadowPlay
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
\fBgsr-ui\fP is a fullscreen overlay UI for GPU Screen Recorder in the style of ShadowPlay.
The application is currently primarily designed for X11 but it can run on Wayland as well through XWayland, with some caveats because of Wayland limitations.
.PP
This interface is built mainly for use with keyboard shortcuts.
When launched for the first time, it runs in the background, ready to receive shortcut keys.
On a subsequent launch, the fullscreen overlay UI appears.
